SUMMARY:LIVE: Wegz (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Flucc
DESCRIPTION:@WANNE | For the first time\, Wegz is touring Europe with his live band. One of the most influential voices shaping Egypt’s contemporary music scene\, Wegz comes to Vienna on October 30 at FLUCC for a completely new live experience\, performing with a full band as part of his first European live band tour. Emerging from Alexandria\, Wegz has become one of the defining artists of a new generation of Arabic music. Blending hip-hop\, trap and Egyptian influences with his distinctive sound\, lyrics and unmistakable energy\, he has built a massive audience across the Arab world and internationally. Over the past years\, Wegz has grown from one of Egypt’s most exciting emerging artists into a major voice in contemporary Arabic music. His tracks have reached millions of listeners\, while his sound has helped bring Egyptian hip-hop and the wider Arabic music scene to audiences far beyond the region. Now\, he is bringing that journey to the stage in a completely new way. This European tour marks a new chapter in Wegz’s live shows\, bringing his music to the stage with a full live band and an entirely new live setup. The show reimagines his music for a live setting\, combining the energy of his performances with the sound and dynamics of a full band. On October 30\, Wegz brings this new live experience to FLUCC Vienna — a chance to experience his music in a format European audiences have never seen before. Early Bird € 33\,50 General Admission € 39 Late Birds €48.00 
URL:https://flucc.at/events/L5i9mo-live-wegz/
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
